            <ArticleTitle>Wound infection-associated pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>245-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Not only does wound infection and the release of pro-inflammatory modulators result in pain and delayed healing, but pain-related stress reduces the immune response to infection. Treatment of pain and infection should be equal priorites.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
